            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ ũthilĩku wa Eliu mwana wa Mbalakeli Mũvusi, wa mũvĩa wa Lamu, wakanie: ũthilĩku wake wamwakanĩa Yovu, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩwetalile mwene mũlũngalu kwĩ kũtalĩla Ngai ũlũngalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
